The &amp;quot;Assistance for Power Driven Chaff Cutter Scheme&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to reduce fodder wastage (25-30%) in dairy farming. By using a power-driven chaff cutter, farmers can efficiently chop green and dry fodder, ensuring better utilization and increased profitability.
